{"data":[{"article":{"title":"🌅 아침 시장 브리핑 — 2026년 10월 15일(목)"},"author_id":"1877517773565472768","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:29:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110483170831536151"],"id":"2110483170831536151","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":52,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"https://t.co/ujM3NWQ2xt","url":"https://x.com/silvercastle_jk/status/2110483170831536151"},{"author_id":"135762800","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:11:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110478586230845806"],"id":"2110478586230845806","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":19,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"[제목] TSMC 실적 서프라이즈 예고…진짜 변수는 텍사스와 테라팹\n\n[내용 요약]\n- TSMC 4분기 매출 가이던스 상단 261억 달러, 영업이익률 58% 돌파 전망\n- 3나노·5나노 가동률 100% 락인, AI 가속기향 CoWoS 캐파 2025년까지 완판\n- 관전 포인트는 실적 아닌 텍사스 팹 추가 투자 및 테라팹(1.4나노)","url":"https://x.com/yis9617/status/2110478586230845806"},{"author_id":"1869731425471152128","created_at":"2026-10-14T20:59:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110475561516642727"],"id":"2110475561516642727","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":2244,"like_count":17,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":1},"text":"AI stocks are down. I’m buying.\n\nI’m not scared of the macro headlines. Tech always finds a way through this stuff, and it ends up showing in earnings and new ATHs.\n\nOf course, ARR questions, neocloud debt rates and inflation fears could send us lower. But I still think the","url":"https://x.com/athuinvests/status/2110475561516642727"},{"author_id":"135762800","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:43:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110486749785084263"],"id":"2110486749785084263","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":14,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"[제목] MS 자체 AI칩 공개…엔비디아 킬러? 본질은 원가 방어임\n\n[내용 요약]\n- MS, 자체 AI 가속기 '마이아 200' 공개. TSMC 3nm 공정, HBM3E 216GB 탑재\n- 추론 성능은 엔비디아 GB200 대비 낮으나, 자사 워크로드 한정 전력당 성능(TCO) 30% 우위 주장\n- 핵심은 범용 판매가 아닌 애저 내부 조달.","url":"https://x.com/yis9617/status/2110486749785084263"},{"author_id":"2000140493104324608","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:58:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110490424699937157"],"id":"2110490424699937157","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"いやASMLの決算の時のように、TSMCの月次決算で普通に下げる可能性あるのよな…","url":"https://x.com/1P7YLXCN9B5391/status/2110490424699937157"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110490452176887808"]},"author_id":"1486997196625297410","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:58:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110490476193484850"],"id":"2110490476193484850","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":101,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110137822434955682","type":"quoted"}],"text":"261014 미장 정리 \n\n9월 CPI 3.7%, 근원 2.6% 둘 다 예상 상회 \n-&gt; 0년물 장중 5.32% 찍고 5.19%로 되돌림\n\n30년물 5.517% 후티 아람코 공격 \n🛢 WTI유 $95.1(+1%) / 브렌트유 $106.1(+0.4%) \n\n보우만 : 9월 인상 효과 지켜볼 시간 있음 \n(CPI 나오기 전 발언이라 약발 없었음) \n\nS&amp;P -1.1%, 나스닥 https://t.co/bKSVYI69dz https://t.co/RZUF7pRxvy","url":"https://x.com/fulllleverage/status/2110490476193484850"},{"author_id":"1057086575283060736","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:59:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110490629352640611"],"id":"2110490629352640611","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":300,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"[피터리 — 2026년 10월 15일 미국장 마감 브리핑]\n\n기준: 미국 2026년 10월 14일 정규장 마감 / 한국 10월 15일 개장 전\n\n① 한눈에 보는 결론\n\n어젯밤 미국장은 이번 조정에서 꽤 중요한 날이다.\n이유는 두 가지다.\n\n첫째, 9월 CPI가 시장 예상보다 높았다.\n\nHeadline CPI는 전월 대비 +0.6%, 전년","url":"https://x.com/PeterLeejoa/status/2110490629352640611"},{"author_id":"1571399759394639875","created_at":"2026-10-14T22:00:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110490951265468732"],"id":"2110490951265468732","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"おはようございます☀\n\n日経先物-1680円📉\n米国のCPIの結果が良すぎて利上げの可能性が高くなったのが原因ですね🥺\n\n運の良いことに信用ノーポジなのが救いです🥹✨現物は多少下げても気にならない💪\n\n残り出勤日数あと2日♪\n諸事情により1日増えたのでカウントストップ😢","url":"https://x.com/70_investor/status/2110490951265468732"},{"author_id":"1958623628201009155","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:00:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110475775740686432"],"id":"2110475775740686432","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":14,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Customers are asking ASML to reserve machines for 2030. Its shares slipped on the news.\n\nOn a day chip stocks kept sliding, the easy read is that investors no longer believe in AI demand. I think that read is backwards.\n\nASML, the Dutch company that makes the lithography machines","url":"https://x.com/LumiritX/status/2110475775740686432"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110482223686447104","3_2110482229411680256","3_2110482234658754560"]},"author_id":"2000210378274549760","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:25:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110482239561814180"],"id":"2110482239561814180","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":230,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"🐸【米国ハイテク/半導体の株価】\n期間: 2026/10/14〜10/15  (終値基準） \n-------------------------------🇺🇲\nCPIが予想より0.1%上振れし、インフレ懸念。追加利上げ警戒のため大幅下落。\n\n（木）TSMC決算：14時頃（株価の反応はガイダンスの内容で乱高下する印象です）\n\n※ https://t.co/FvIhNaMBqc","url":"https://x.com/kabu_0rekaeru/status/2110482239561814180"},{"author_id":"1373569238061912069","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:40:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110485882151293431"],"id":"2110485882151293431","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":680,"like_count":0,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"AIトレンドニュース要点（CTEE記事）\n詳細は該当するCTEE抽出記事Noを参照のこと\n\nI. 半導体製造・先端実装――設備需要の長期化と供給能力の拡張\n\n先端製造では、\nTSMCの決算前の期待と、\nASMLが示した設備需要の強さが中心となっている。\n\nTSMCについて、","url":"https://x.com/Nikola_pn2501/status/2110485882151293431"},{"author_id":"1539288932776435712","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:51:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110488595790516574"],"id":"2110488595790516574","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"おは木🌳\n\n株価は下がるのに、電線の仕入価格は下がりません。\n世の中うまくできてますね。\n\nASMLが好決算！\nAI需要は強く、2028年まで供給不足の可能性も📈\n\n今朝のポイント👇\n🇺🇸ダウ−0.09％、NASDAQ−1.88％\n🇯🇵日経平均67,744円（−33円）\n📉日経先物は66,480円まで下落\n📊米CPI＋3.7％で利上げ警戒","url":"https://x.com/takutama_005/status/2110488595790516574"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110481673150201857"]},"author_id":"1383754964665716740","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:23:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110481680104398863"],"id":"2110481680104398863","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":42,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Daily Summary — October 14, 2026\n\nCRYPTOCRAT | INSTITUTIONAL MARKET INTELLIGENCE\n\nUS inflation came in hotter than expected, triggering a sharp selloff in technology stocks and crypto.\n\nUS CPI — SEPTEMBER\n\nHeadline: 3.7% YoY\nCore: 2.6% YoY\nCore monthly: 0.3%\n\nAll exceeded https://t.co/nJEOriRhvW","url":"https://x.com/Cryptocratico/status/2110481680104398863"},{"author_id":"1061950889055973376","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:36:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110484996011995430"],"id":"2110484996011995430","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":33,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"#BreveMercado — 14 de octubre\n\nFitch mejoró la calificación soberana de Argentina a B desde B- con perspectiva estable. Segunda suba de nota en menos de dos semanas. Destaca consolidación fiscal, acumulación de reservas y éxito en los canjes de deuda.\n\nBCRA compró US$82M en el","url":"https://x.com/fmarenco_/status/2110484996011995430"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110487270587531264"]},"author_id":"1370696511424581635","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:45:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110487276937691546"],"id":"2110487276937691546","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":436,"like_count":18,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"🇺🇸米国相場\n【半導体ショック】\nASMLは好決算、それでもSOX急落↓↓\n\n10/14の米国市場\nNASDAQ　約-1.9%\nSOX　　 約-4.3%↓↓\n\n「半導体需要は強い」\nそれなのに、なぜ株価は下がるのでしょうか？🤔\n\n✅ ASMLの決算内容\n\n・売上高 約117億ユーロ\n・純利益 約50億ユーロ https://t.co/HG4ZKT7P6N","url":"https://x.com/OssanJam/status/2110487276937691546"},{"article":{"title":"Daily Tech Briefing (Oct 15, 2026)"},"author_id":"1916470687830781952","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:37:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110485168737923374"],"id":"2110485168737923374","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"On a day of bills, the supplier others can switch to gets paid. 👇\n\n#CPI #ASML #HBM https://t.co/MTNKHThrTo","url":"https://x.com/obandit123/status/2110485168737923374"},{"author_id":"4274391","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:03:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110476726266364015"],"id":"2110476726266364015","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1589,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"【株クラ朝トピック｜2026-10-15】\n昨日の市場ニュースで目立った話題の観測メモ（売買推奨ではない）\n※対象はおおむね 2026-10-14朝〜2026-10-15朝（JST・約24時間）。14日夜の米CPIとASML決算が本丸。\n\n① 米急落の余波：CME日経先物は朝方6万6505円前後（約−2.5%）。寄り前の位置取りが焦点","url":"https://x.com/pyon/status/2110476726266364015"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110480006044684288"]},"author_id":"1123422180274872325","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:17:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110480066752950523"],"id":"2110480066752950523","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":50,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"#投資 #米国株 #株式市場 #日本株 #日経平均\n🇺🇸🇯🇵 【米CPI上振れと半導体急落・原油95ドル】10/15早朝 市況概況ダイジェスト\n【主要市場指標（厳選コアサマリー）】\n\n・米国市場（10/14確定終値）:\n NYダウ 51,621.48ドル（-48.62ドル / -0.09%）\n S&amp;P 500 7,718.94pt（-86.51pt / -1.11%）\nナスダック https://t.co/ju7jfd1wJQ","url":"https://x.com/Tokusan1968/status/2110480066752950523"},{"article":{"title":"Wednesday Scraps for October 14 '26"},"author_id":"2050739942892990465","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:14:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110479270468370712"],"id":"2110479270468370712","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":84,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"https://t.co/mfqOVModcJ","url":"https://x.com/fintwitscraps/status/2110479270468370712"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110480466268819456"]},"author_id":"775960805447565312","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:19:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110480759706575142"],"id":"2110480759706575142","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":3676,"like_count":14,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":3},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108897840739037386","type":"quoted"}],"text":"📘 #毎朝の相場まとめ｜10/15（木）\n【CPI上振れでAI関連安。医療・生活必需品に買い】\n\n昨夜の米国株🇺🇸は、\nCPI上振れで追加利上げへの警戒が強まり、\n半導体・AIインフラが大幅下落。\n一方、医療・生活必需品がダウを下支えしました。\n\n🟥 NYダウ：▲0.09%\n🟥 S&amp;P500：▲1.11%\n🟥 https://t.co/25ZcBp7a3M https://t.co/TV1uh5Kyp0","url":"https://x.com/t_ryoma1985/status/2110480759706575142"},{"author_id":"1181655120393564160","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:39:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110485577636438371"],"id":"2110485577636438371","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"📌 本日の日本市場展望（10/15）｜急落を買い場と決めず、売りの範囲と戻る力を測る\n\n✅ 日経225先物は66,480円。前日現物終値を約1,264円下回る\n👀 半導体の下落幅より、金融・資源・内需まで売りが広がるかを確認\n⚠️ 本日15時からTSMC決算説明会。業績の強さと、上昇を維持できる条件は別","url":"https://x.com/kyokan_brief/status/2110485577636438371"},{"article":{"title":"10月15日 日本株朝チェック｜資源の相対優位と金融の反転失敗、AI関連は業績と株価を分けて判断"},"author_id":"2010213345849397248","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:44:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110486905536360788"],"id":"2110486905536360788","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":234,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"資源は強い。でも今から買えるとは限らない。銀行の反発は続かず、非鉄も海外指標との足並みがそろわない朝。今日の資金移動と2〜4週間の反転候補を分け、石油・石炭と医薬品の確認条件を整理しました。 https://t.co/imqbCOB7qa","url":"https://x.com/geneki_junbi/status/2110486905536360788"},{"author_id":"1099519108809256960","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:25:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110482032753324268"],"id":"2110482032753324268","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":751,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"📊10/14米国市場・終値分析  \n10/15から始まる日本市場への影響\n\nおはようございます。  \n億サラリーマン投資家です☺️  \n今朝確定の米株終値です（米国10/14・水）。\n\n🔸NYダウ　51,621.48  \n（−48.62　−0.09%）ほぼ横ばい  \n🔸S&amp;P500　7,718.94  \n（−86.51","url":"https://x.com/okusalaryman/status/2110482032753324268"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110479704125812737","3_2110479718004764672","3_2110479733376901121"]},"author_id":"931765564388921344","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:16:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110479765836894581"],"id":"2110479765836894581","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":11,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"Ex-CEO da Intel critica HBM; Nanya prevê escassez de DRAM até 2028 por causa da produção de HBM. Fonte: WCCFtech. https://t.co/tNMJ2DEsAm","url":"https://x.com/japahttv/status/2110479765836894581"},{"author_id":"1269514296054054913","created_at":"2026-10-14T21:24:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110481834270507214"],"id":"2110481834270507214","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":16,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"HBM仍是AI加速器關鍵，卻集中頻寬、散熱與封裝空間矛盾。Intel前執行長Pat Gelsinger雖批評設計，仍稱它是目前最可行方案。\n\nPat Gelsinger近日受訪稱，HBM位元密度偏低，受晶片邊緣頻寬、功耗與散熱限制；大量資料集中同一區域，對依賴記憶體與運算效能的AI工作負載尤其棘手。","url":"https://x.com/userHandle/status/2110481834270507214"}],"includes":{"media":[{"media_key":"3_21104904521